---
// MarketingFeatureBlocks.astro
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-white relative">
  <div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col gap-24 lg:gap-32">
    
    <!-- Feature Block 1: Image Left, Text Right -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-span-6 relative w-full rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl h-[350px] sm:h-[400px]">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Data analytics dashboard strategy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col space-y-5">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">
          <span class="text-blue-600">Identificarea</span> URL-urilor și conținuturilor relevante
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Dacă se modifică structura, conținutul sau tehnologia, migrarea este planificată de la început.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature Block 2: Text Left, Image Right -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="order-1 lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col space-y-5">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">
          <span class="text-blue-600">Controlul</span> legăturilor interne, titlurilor, etichetelor canonice și indexării
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Aceste măsuri reduc riscurile tehnice cunoscute. Nu pot fi garantate poziții în motoarele de căutare, volume de trafic sau rezultate comerciale.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="order-2 lg:col-span-6 relative w-full rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl h-[350px] sm:h-[400px]">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Modern digital strategy planning" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
